# R3025 CVTRPGSRC pub400.com
      * Signs and zones: MOVE of negative numbers, zoned results.
     H
     FQSYSPRT   O    F  132        PRINTER OFLIND(*INOF)
     C                   Z-ADD     -7            N2                2 0
     C                   MOVE      N2            C2                2
     C                   MOVE      '1P'          N2B               2 0
     C                   Z-ADD     N2B           P3                3 0
     C                   MOVE      -12.5         C5                5
     C                   Z-ADD     0             Z5                5 2
     C                   SUB       0.01          Z5
     C                   MULT      -1            Z5
     C                   EXCEPT    LINE
     C                   SETON                                        LR
     OQSYSPRT   E            LINE           1
     O                       C2                   5
     O                       N2B           J     15
     O                       P3            J     25
     O                       C5                  35
     O                       Z5            J     45
     O                       Z5                  55
